# Per-render sidecar reports, regenerated by render.js on every run alongside
# the .mp4 above and never tracked (git ls-files data/renders/ has always been
# empty). The numbers that matter are recorded in CHECK-REGISTER.md; these
# files are the run's own output, not source.
